'''Kenshin Himura''' (緋村剣心, '''''Himura Kenshin''''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy from the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kenshin Himura
|image = E 688.png
|first appearance = [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
A generic backliner with average damage and high survivability. Think of him as [[Le'boin]] with a faster attack rate and 3 knockbacks.

==Strategy==
Given how quickly he attacks, you'll want to outrange him with units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. Additionally, you can also rush him with [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] or Awakened Bahamut Cat if available. Go in for the kill as soon as he's vulnerable, it's likely he'd do the same against you.

